name: Bug report
about: Report a problem in the package, repository docs, or GitHub/community surface
title: "[Bug]: "
labels: ["bug"]
assignees: []
---

## Summary

Describe the bug clearly and briefly.

## Affected Area

Select or describe the area involved:

- package behavior or published guidance
- build, test, or repository setup
- repository documentation or structure
- GitHub or community-health files

## Expected Behavior

What did you expect to happen?

## Actual Behavior

What happened instead?

## Reproduction

List the smallest steps needed to reproduce the problem.

## Evidence

Include relevant commands and their output, package and toolchain versions,
and links to affected code, documentation, or related issues.

## Decision Needed

What decision is needed to resolve this issue?

## Completion Check

How will completion be verified? Name the tests, commands, or observable
acceptance criteria.

## Notes

Add any context that may help reviewers understand the issue faster.
